Error [jet.InvalidScopedPolicy]: `frobnicate` is not a scoped policy
  --> tests/ui/policy_conflicting_module.jet:1:9
    |
  1 | #Policy(frobnicate)
    |         ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The compiler owns the closed policy registry and its scope rules
 Fix: Use `gc`, `explicit_units`, `copies: .Explicit`, `sentries: .Off`, or `arithmetic: .Wrapping`; write memory floors as `!Mem.*` effect denials
